# Translations

Follow `.cursor/skills/translations/SKILL.md`.

There must be no hardcoded user-facing text. Everything the user reads is
defined in `apps/web/src/i18n/locales/en/common.json` and
`apps/web/src/i18n/locales/pl/common.json`, in the same change.

The engine sends `code`s (`NoticeEvent`, `ErrorEvent`), never a sentence for
the screen. `ErrorEvent.message` is an English log detail only.
